  "name": null,
  "problem": "Consider the set $C=(-2,-1].$ Complete the following reasoning to identify $sup(C).$\n\nThe supremum of a set $C$ is the {{field-1}} of $C.$\n\nThe set of upper bounds of $C$ is as follows:\n\n$$\n\\{x\\in R\\,:\\,x{{field-2}}{{field-3}}\\}\n$$\n\nTherefore, {{field-4}}.",
